{'symbol': 'TECH', 'date': '2022-08-18 07:00:00', 'title': 'BIO-TECHNE ANNOUNCES RELEASE OF QUANTIST LUMINEX® DATA ANALYSIS SOFTWARE', 'text': 'MINNEAPOLIS , AUG. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- BIO-TECHNE CORPORATION (NASDAQ: TECH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT R&D SYSTEMS®, A BIO-TECHNE BRAND, HAS RELEASED ITS NEW QUANTIST LUMINEX® DATA ANALYSIS SOFTWARE. COMPATIBLE WITH ALL AVAILABLE LUMINEX XMAP® INSTRUMENTS, QUANTIST SOFTWARE PROVIDES FAST, RELIABLE ANALYSIS OF LUMINEX MULTIPLEX ASSAY DATA, HELPING RESEARCHERS EXTRACT VALUABLE INSIGHTS FROM COMPLEX DATA.'}